{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sFZvjhLdEM1794813877.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產元朗區域營業經理王勤學表示，元朗嘉城大廈低層D室，實用面積554平方呎，兩房間隔，新近以415萬元成交，實用呎價7491元，為該廈相隔接近兩年後，造價再度突破400萬元大關，創近2年新高。<br/>王勤學表示，單位內櫳企理，附帶部份傢俬。買家為投資客，預計單位月租約1.3萬元，租金回報預計達3.8厘。原業主於2013年12月以320萬元買入單位，持貨約13年，賬面賺95萬元，升值30%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:04:09.575808+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T02:57:14.400856+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T06:57:17.656296+00:00","content_hash":"29a0d2094c13d0c9062f73f42fa01b9f395642b2e3a3598c78da5b11ee8a4df6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:04:09.575808+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}